WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:56.400
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:56.670 --> 00:58.010
This thing won't break easily.

3
00:58.710 --> 01:00.220
I must break through the barrier

4
01:00.350 --> 01:01.660
before the seal is complete.

5
01:11.290 --> 01:11.750
Master.

6
01:13.550 --> 01:14.980
Qi Fengyin is trying to break the barrier.

7
01:15.240 --> 01:16.730
We must activate the Wanjun Lock first.

8
01:18.240 --> 01:18.940
Stay focused!

9
01:19.110 --> 01:19.530
Yes, Master!

10
01:19.960 --> 01:21.130
Activate the Wanjun Lock!

11
01:48.460 --> 01:54.340
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

12
01:56.380 --> 02:02.340
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

13
02:03.380 --> 02:07.620
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

14
02:11.300 --> 02:18.860
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

15
02:19.220 --> 02:25.980
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

16
02:27.220 --> 02:33.860
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

17
02:35.060 --> 02:41.900
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

18
02:43.500 --> 02:50.020
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

19
02:54.780 --> 02:56.580
[Blossom in Darkness]

20
02:56.580 --> 02:58.580
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

21
02:58.580 --> 03:01.580
[Episode 2]

22
03:01.960 --> 03:03.500
That rotten Qi Fengyin!

23
03:04.320 --> 03:05.500
I told him I wouldn't run away!

24
03:05.760 --> 03:07.250
Yet he planted me in a place like this!

25
03:14.800 --> 03:16.250
Once the Wanjun Lock is fully formed,

26
03:17.110 --> 03:17.910
all of Mount Qihuang

27
03:17.910 --> 03:18.980
will be sealed up tight.

28
03:19.360 --> 03:20.370
Not even a breeze will get through.

29
03:21.120 --> 03:21.860
Being planted here

30
03:22.280 --> 03:23.300
with that awful devil

31
03:23.320 --> 03:23.820
is bad enough.

32
03:24.150 --> 03:25.610
But Master will never wake up.

33
03:30.600 --> 03:32.980
You can't break free on your own.

34
03:38.600 --> 03:39.610
How are you still alive?

35
03:40.160 --> 03:42.330
I'm a mighty ancient demon.

36
03:43.600 --> 03:45.820
No one alive is powerful enough to kill me.

37
03:46.040 --> 03:47.670
You took over Master's stuffed doll.

38
03:47.670 --> 03:48.430
I could've let that slide.

39
03:48.880 --> 03:49.770
What exactly do you want?

40
03:50.350 --> 03:51.770
Who wants this ugly doll?

41
03:51.950 --> 03:53.330
When you were being hunted,

42
03:53.510 --> 03:55.380
I panicked and possessed the wrong body.

43
03:56.160 --> 03:56.880
Promise me

44
03:56.880 --> 03:58.260
you'll get me out of here.

45
03:58.750 --> 04:00.450
And stuff me with more cotton

46
04:00.790 --> 04:02.980
so I look like a stunning beauty.

47
04:03.510 --> 04:04.610
Then I'll set you free.

48
04:09.560 --> 04:10.330
We're running out of time.

49
04:12.910 --> 04:14.100
Fine, fine! I promise!

50
04:46.960 --> 04:47.410
Madam!

51
04:52.680 --> 04:53.220
It seems

52
04:54.070 --> 04:55.900
even with the Tidal Divine Artifact,

53
04:56.600 --> 04:58.460
the Five Great Sects can't defeat Qi Fengyin.

54
04:58.950 --> 05:00.290
The immortal sects are doomed.

55
05:00.950 --> 05:02.170
If we keep fighting alongside them,

56
05:03.120 --> 05:04.490
we'll lose everything.

57
05:12.360 --> 05:13.980
Su Hexiang's immortal power is gone.

58
05:14.190 --> 05:14.660
Master.

59
05:15.070 --> 05:16.340
The array is forming more slowly.

60
05:17.360 --> 05:18.170
Stay focused!

61
05:21.750 --> 05:22.490
Are you sure you can do this?

62
05:24.070 --> 05:25.050
I'm even more desperate to

63
05:25.120 --> 05:25.780
get out of here than you are.

64
05:32.480 --> 05:34.100
I've been looking everywhere for you.

65
05:34.750 --> 05:36.410
I only came to try my luck.

66
05:37.000 --> 05:38.340
I never thought you'd still be alive.

67
05:39.070 --> 05:40.020
Su Hexiang?

68
05:40.870 --> 05:41.850
What are you doing here?

69
05:43.270 --> 05:44.410
Shouldn't all the immortal sects

70
05:44.750 --> 05:45.620
be working together

71
05:45.620 --> 05:46.610
to seal Mount Qihuang?

72
05:47.510 --> 05:48.900
If Qi Fengyin weren't

73
05:49.360 --> 05:50.900
busy fighting the Wanjun Lock,

74
05:51.720 --> 05:52.700
do you think I'd risk

75
05:52.750 --> 05:53.780
entering Mount Qihuang?

76
05:54.680 --> 05:55.780
How else would I have found you?

77
06:20.480 --> 06:21.290
You're incredibly powerful.

78
06:21.750 --> 06:22.830
Hardly anyone in this world

79
06:22.830 --> 06:23.540
can stand against you.

80
06:23.950 --> 06:24.850
Why risk everything

81
06:24.870 --> 06:25.660
over a single herb?

82
06:26.270 --> 06:27.610
Whether you're worth eating

83
06:28.950 --> 06:30.540
depends entirely on my mood.

84
06:43.190 --> 06:44.580
You're about to die,

85
06:45.160 --> 06:46.580
yet you're still struggling.

86
06:56.870 --> 06:58.490
Instead of falling into that devil's hands,

87
06:59.190 --> 07:00.170
you'd be better off

88
07:00.190 --> 07:00.930
letting me capture you.

89
07:01.310 --> 07:02.460
I'll even grant your wish

90
07:03.040 --> 07:04.370
and bring your master back to life.

91
07:04.560 --> 07:05.970
If you're going to lie to me,

92
07:05.970 --> 07:06.980
at least make it believable.

93
07:07.240 --> 07:08.790
Why save my master if you're going to eat me?

94
07:08.870 --> 07:10.260
My master cares deeply about me.

95
07:10.310 --> 07:11.700
He'd kill you to avenge my death.

96
07:11.830 --> 07:12.780
I'm not falling for that!

97
07:16.040 --> 07:17.490
At least now you know the truth.

98
07:18.040 --> 07:19.170
I'll only take your herb core.

99
07:19.510 --> 07:20.980
You won't feel a thing.

100
07:45.360 --> 07:46.100
Qi Fengyin?

101
07:59.560 --> 08:00.140
If you're here,

102
08:00.360 --> 08:01.170
how will you handle the Wanjun Lock?

103
08:01.360 --> 08:02.100
What about the seal?

104
08:02.550 --> 08:03.380
Once the array is complete,

105
08:03.430 --> 08:04.330
we'll be trapped here forever!

106
08:04.400 --> 08:04.940
We'll never escape!

107
08:05.230 --> 08:06.600
Just make sure the mystical flower

108
08:06.600 --> 08:07.210
stays safe.

109
08:08.470 --> 08:09.740
Leave everything else to me.

110
08:11.050 --> 08:12.290
I have no desire to make an enemy of you.

111
08:12.990 --> 08:14.330
I only want to take that girl.

112
08:14.670 --> 08:15.290
Surely the Wanjun Lock

113
08:15.670 --> 08:16.650
matters more to you

114
08:16.670 --> 08:17.410
than she does.

115
09:46.190 --> 09:47.930
No wonder you're the devil who slaughtered the immortal sects.

116
09:48.430 --> 09:50.140
Even without the Devil Incarnate powers,

117
09:50.880 --> 09:52.220
you're too strong for me to defeat alone.

118
09:53.240 --> 09:54.460
I overestimated myself.

119
10:37.950 --> 10:38.930
I'll find a way

120
10:38.950 --> 10:39.530
to survive on my own.

121
10:39.670 --> 10:40.460
You should focus on dealing with

122
10:40.480 --> 10:41.380
the Wanjun Lock array.

123
10:41.530 --> 10:42.290
That no longer matters.

124
10:43.520 --> 10:44.930
I have the Wanjun Lock.

125
10:47.310 --> 10:48.530
The barrier is broken.

126
11:20.550 --> 11:21.140
Master.

127
11:21.710 --> 11:22.050
You...

128
11:23.360 --> 11:24.220
That devil...

129
11:26.430 --> 11:28.100
He's finally been unleashed.

130
11:33.020 --> 11:35.180
[Mount Qihuang]

131
11:50.120 --> 11:52.740
The Wanjun Lock seems to be suppressing his power.

132
12:05.550 --> 12:07.100
Take me to the person we just saw.

133
12:08.120 --> 12:09.140
You mean Su Hexiang?

134
12:10.910 --> 12:12.140
You want me to take you to her?

135
12:13.310 --> 12:14.860
Now that Mount Qihuang's seal is broken,

136
12:15.070 --> 12:16.530
the immortal sects will surely fight back.

137
12:16.670 --> 12:18.810
Qi Fengyin has been trapped here for so long.

138
12:19.070 --> 12:20.140
He knows nothing of the outside world.

139
12:20.360 --> 12:22.340
If I can trick him into going to Mount Zhaowu...

140
12:23.310 --> 12:23.810
Wait for me.

141
12:26.590 --> 12:27.430
At a time like this,

142
12:27.430 --> 12:28.500
why are you still carrying that thing?

143
12:29.070 --> 12:30.620
She's a disciple of the immortal sects.

144
12:30.910 --> 12:32.340
Once we're on their territory,

145
12:32.480 --> 12:34.050
she'll team up with those wretched immortals

146
12:34.120 --> 12:34.770
to plot against you

147
12:34.880 --> 12:35.460
and trick you!

148
12:35.710 --> 12:37.410
I'm the mighty ancient demon.

149
12:37.520 --> 12:39.100
The immortal cultivators are my sworn enemies.

150
12:39.360 --> 12:40.340
I'll make sure to clear away

151
12:40.360 --> 12:41.980
every obstacle and trap in your path.

152
12:42.170 --> 12:43.260
That wretched doll.

153
12:43.590 --> 12:44.740
It switched sides just like that.

154
12:53.620 --> 12:55.740
[Youyou]

155
13:05.550 --> 13:06.650
I have a human body now!

156
13:08.040 --> 13:09.020
From now on, I'm a mighty demon,

157
13:09.310 --> 13:10.380
and you're the greatest mighty demon of all!

158
13:10.670 --> 13:12.100
You are my lord!

159
13:13.670 --> 13:14.620
Lord?

160
13:15.070 --> 13:16.430
You call yourself a mighty demon,

161
13:16.740 --> 13:17.930
yet you're happy to be someone's servant?

162
13:17.970 --> 13:18.620
Have you no shame?

163
13:19.000 --> 13:19.740
What do you know?

164
13:19.830 --> 13:21.340
I've survived for thousands of years

165
13:21.590 --> 13:22.500
because I know when

166
13:22.640 --> 13:24.290
to swallow my pride and have no shame.

167
13:25.040 --> 13:25.770
Greetings, My Lord.

168
13:26.550 --> 13:27.860
Just say the word, and I'll obey.

169
13:28.040 --> 13:28.460
I shall...

170
13:28.790 --> 13:29.530
No, no.

171
13:29.590 --> 13:31.340
Your humble servant will see to it.

172
13:31.880 --> 13:32.460
Keep an eye on her.

173
13:32.590 --> 13:33.100
As you command.

174
13:39.310 --> 13:41.140
If you ever run away again,

175
13:41.590 --> 13:42.470
it really would cause

176
13:42.480 --> 13:43.460
some unnecessary trouble.

177
13:43.880 --> 13:45.340
As long as I keep you alive,

178
13:46.160 --> 13:47.650
breaking both your arms and legs

179
13:48.120 --> 13:49.380
shouldn't be a problem, right?

180
13:53.000 --> 13:54.140
You just saved my life.

181
13:54.240 --> 13:55.810
Why would I run when I should be

182
13:55.950 --> 13:56.860
sticking close to you?

183
13:58.710 --> 13:59.620
You don't have to remind me.

184
13:59.760 --> 14:00.740
I know what'll happen

185
14:00.790 --> 14:01.650
if I try to escape

186
14:01.670 --> 14:02.410
or lead you the wrong way.

187
14:03.000 --> 14:03.810
I value my life.

188
14:04.550 --> 14:06.170
I'd never do anything that foolish.

189
14:06.830 --> 14:08.100
What should I call you two?

190
14:08.710 --> 14:09.890
I'm Youyou.

191
14:14.120 --> 14:14.890
I'm Yamao.

192
14:17.160 --> 14:17.860
Qi Fengyin?

193
14:18.160 --> 14:19.220
Yes, I know.

194
14:22.070 --> 14:23.620
Where's that woman who's carrying

195
14:24.040 --> 14:24.620
my malice?

196
14:29.790 --> 14:30.500
Mount Leiguan.

197
14:44.400 --> 14:46.500
A helpless little girl managed to

198
14:47.310 --> 14:48.570
fool me for so long.

199
14:54.900 --> 14:57.020
[Mount Qihuang]

200
15:00.880 --> 15:01.340
Master.

201
15:02.760 --> 15:03.530
None of the sects have found

202
15:03.550 --> 15:04.460
any trace of Qi Fengyin.

203
15:04.880 --> 15:05.530
I'm afraid

204
15:06.280 --> 15:07.140
he's already escaped.

205
15:07.480 --> 15:08.340
Qi Fengyin

206
15:08.910 --> 15:10.690
may have broken Mount Qihuang's barrier,

207
15:12.120 --> 15:13.050
but the Wanjun Lock

208
15:13.520 --> 15:14.930
still managed to bind him.

209
15:15.240 --> 15:16.140
With the divine artifact suppressing him,

210
15:16.550 --> 15:18.050
his power must be weakened.

211
15:18.830 --> 15:20.100
Before he becomes the Devil Incarnate,

212
15:20.430 --> 15:21.740
we still have a chance to stop him.

213
15:22.280 --> 15:22.740
Hao,

214
15:23.760 --> 15:25.410
send word to all the immortal sects.

215
15:26.590 --> 15:28.220
Send our disciples down the mountain, too.

216
15:28.590 --> 15:29.930
Search every last corner

217
15:30.520 --> 15:31.770
until we capture that devil.

218
15:32.310 --> 15:32.740
Yes, Master.

219
15:33.480 --> 15:33.890
Wait.

220
15:35.640 --> 15:36.570
Go to Mount Leiguan.

221
15:37.160 --> 15:37.930
Find out

222
15:38.360 --> 15:39.380
how Su Hexiang is doing.

223
15:40.830 --> 15:41.860
Everyone assumes

224
15:42.240 --> 15:44.050
Qi Fengyin was simply too powerful,

225
15:44.520 --> 15:46.500
so he shattered the Wanjun Lock's barrier.

226
15:47.430 --> 15:48.740
But I know what I saw.

227
15:49.950 --> 15:51.380
If Mount Leiguan's array

228
15:51.670 --> 15:52.570
hadn't suddenly failed

229
15:52.790 --> 15:53.740
and dropped its defenses,

230
15:54.360 --> 15:54.980
everything

231
15:55.480 --> 15:57.380
wouldn't have fallen apart so quickly.

232
15:57.830 --> 15:58.260
Hao,

233
15:59.590 --> 16:00.500
before you begin searching

234
16:01.160 --> 16:02.500
for Qi Fengyin,

235
16:03.760 --> 16:04.930
go to Mount Leiguan first.

236
16:05.170 --> 16:05.980
- Master! - Master!

237
16:06.240 --> 16:06.690
Master!

238
16:20.160 --> 16:21.220
Master, your internal injuries are severe.

239
16:21.880 --> 16:23.530
You should stay here and recover in seclusion.

240
16:26.480 --> 16:27.460
Now that Qi Fengyin

241
16:28.550 --> 16:29.500
has been unleashed,

242
16:30.070 --> 16:30.650
Danshen

243
16:31.070 --> 16:31.890
has also died.

244
16:32.120 --> 16:33.380
I must personally

245
16:34.070 --> 16:35.980
guard the Saintess's Shrine.

246
16:36.430 --> 16:37.340
Only then can I rest easy.

247
16:38.100 --> 16:42.500
[Mount Leiguan]

248
16:42.500 --> 16:45.220
[Zixiao Retreat]

249
17:17.680 --> 17:18.530
What are you doing here?

250
17:31.250 --> 17:32.500
Wh-What's happening?

251
17:33.390 --> 17:34.260
The Wanjun Lock!

252
17:55.280 --> 17:55.770
You...

253
17:56.480 --> 17:57.850
Wh-What are you doing?

254
18:07.220 --> 18:08.650
The malice inside Su Hexiang

255
18:08.650 --> 18:09.730
is still on Mount Leiguan.

256
18:10.380 --> 18:12.130
But I can't pinpoint her location.

257
18:12.390 --> 18:13.460
That woman, Su Hexiang,

258
18:13.500 --> 18:14.610
must have found some way

259
18:14.790 --> 18:15.810
to hide herself.

260
18:16.040 --> 18:17.700
We'll search every inch of Mount Leiguan.

261
18:18.110 --> 18:19.020
We're bound to find her.

262
18:19.310 --> 18:21.420
Mount Leiguan is one of the Five Great Sects.

263
18:21.790 --> 18:22.850
If you cause such a scene,

264
18:23.110 --> 18:24.330
aren't you afraid the sects will attack?

265
18:24.720 --> 18:25.900
I'll kill anyone who comes.

266
18:26.190 --> 18:27.020
Are we wiping out the whole sect?

267
18:27.220 --> 18:28.610
I'll clear the way for My Lord!

268
18:29.370 --> 18:30.900
Neither of you is killing anyone!

269
18:36.360 --> 18:37.090
Come on, let's go.

270
18:37.100 --> 18:37.690
Move, move.

271
18:37.690 --> 18:38.700
Hurry up!

272
18:38.700 --> 18:39.260
Over here!

273
18:44.590 --> 18:45.290
Qi Fengyin!

274
18:46.550 --> 18:47.980
If you really want your malice back,

275
18:48.040 --> 18:48.740
you can't hurt

276
18:48.760 --> 18:49.610
anyone here.

277
18:50.000 --> 18:51.290
That'll only make things worse.

278
18:51.760 --> 18:52.940
What do you mean, worse?

279
18:53.680 --> 18:55.370
It means causing trouble we don't need.

280
18:58.870 --> 19:00.940
Every immortal sect is hunting you now.

281
19:01.480 --> 19:02.940
If you reveal who you are

282
19:03.280 --> 19:05.020
before you can reclaim your malice,

283
19:05.280 --> 19:06.050
you'll have to face

284
19:06.070 --> 19:07.260
an attack from all five sects and their allies.

285
19:07.460 --> 19:08.160
Once the fighting starts,

286
19:08.160 --> 19:09.130
it'll never end.

287
19:10.230 --> 19:10.770
Madam.

288
19:11.070 --> 19:12.940
Yuwen Hao, Chief Disciple of Mount Zhaowu,

289
19:13.110 --> 19:13.980
requests an audience with you.

290
19:14.680 --> 19:15.290
Yuwen Hao?

291
19:18.630 --> 19:20.500
Those immortals from Mount Zhaowu are the worst.

292
19:20.760 --> 19:21.220
My Lord.

293
19:21.380 --> 19:22.500
Don't let them find you.

294
19:33.090 --> 19:34.940
I'm not receiving visitors today.

295
19:34.960 --> 19:35.900
Send him away.

296
19:36.870 --> 19:37.370
Yes, Madam.

297
19:52.520 --> 19:54.090
Mount Leiguan is one of the Five Great Sects,

298
19:54.550 --> 19:55.570
a respected immortal sect.

299
19:55.680 --> 19:56.890
Yet Madam Su

300
19:57.300 --> 19:58.280
has taken in so many

301
19:58.280 --> 19:59.900
inner disciples with so little talent.

302
20:00.940 --> 20:01.830
She claims she's doing it

303
20:01.830 --> 20:03.660
to recruit talent and spread immortal arts.

304
20:04.200 --> 20:05.020
But I think

305
20:05.550 --> 20:07.020
she's lost her devotion to cultivation.

306
20:07.520 --> 20:08.370
It's disgraceful.

307
20:09.110 --> 20:10.420
In the old days, Mount Leiguan

308
20:10.590 --> 20:11.660
had strict rules.

309
20:12.310 --> 20:13.260
Its disciples' training

310
20:13.520 --> 20:14.740
was especially grueling,

311
20:15.000 --> 20:16.740
even tougher than Mount Zhaowu's.

312
20:17.350 --> 20:18.050
Who would've thought

313
20:18.620 --> 20:19.700
that under her leadership,

314
20:20.370 --> 20:21.980
it would fall so far?

315
20:22.590 --> 20:23.090
Yinhua.

316
20:24.040 --> 20:25.460
You and Zhiwei should keep your voices down.

317
20:25.830 --> 20:26.770
Someone might hear you.

318
20:27.110 --> 20:29.020
If Madam Su dares to act this way,

319
20:29.240 --> 20:30.330
why should she care what people say?

320
20:36.520 --> 20:37.180
Sorry to keep you waiting.

321
20:38.830 --> 20:40.130
Our madam hasn't been feeling well lately.

322
20:40.280 --> 20:40.980
She's unable to receive visitors.

323
20:41.110 --> 20:41.660
Please leave.

324
20:42.150 --> 20:42.810
I've come

325
20:43.000 --> 20:44.460
on my master's orders to check on her.

326
20:44.680 --> 20:45.570
I ask that Madam Su

327
20:45.870 --> 20:46.570
spare a moment to see us.

328
20:46.830 --> 20:47.660
I'm afraid that's not possible.

329
20:48.200 --> 20:48.980
Please leave.

330
20:51.350 --> 20:51.900
Then...

331
20:52.900 --> 20:53.850
Forgive the intrusion.

332
21:04.870 --> 21:05.330
Stop!

333
21:06.440 --> 21:07.330
You can't come in here!

334
21:07.590 --> 21:08.770
I've heard Mount Zhaowu's disciples

335
21:08.790 --> 21:09.530
are careful with your words and actions.

336
21:09.620 --> 21:10.610
I never expected

337
21:10.630 --> 21:11.330
such thuggish behavior!

338
21:12.830 --> 21:14.090
These are our madam's private chambers.

339
21:14.280 --> 21:14.980
You can't just barge in!

340
21:15.030 --> 21:16.050
If you anger her,

341
21:16.050 --> 21:17.290
don't say I didn't warn you!

342
21:40.350 --> 21:40.980
What are you doing?

343
21:50.630 --> 21:51.290
Hao!

344
21:52.310 --> 21:53.180
I've been hoping you'd come.

345
21:53.200 --> 21:54.330
I knew you wouldn't let me down!

346
21:54.560 --> 21:55.340
The last time we met

347
21:55.340 --> 21:56.290
was so long ago.

348
21:56.910 --> 21:57.920
Don't you remember me?

349
21:58.810 --> 21:59.660
Please show some restraint.

350
22:00.590 --> 22:01.180
Madam Su.

351
22:03.000 --> 22:03.370
You...

352
22:04.280 --> 22:05.180
What did you just call me?

353
22:06.870 --> 22:07.700
Madam Su.

354
22:41.680 --> 22:42.090
No, I...

355
22:42.100 --> 22:43.180
My master sent me

356
22:43.230 --> 22:44.430
to check on you, Madam Su.

357
22:44.430 --> 22:46.080
Now that I see you're doing well,

358
22:46.200 --> 22:46.810
I can put my mind at ease.

359
22:47.590 --> 22:48.370
But there's something I don't understand.

360
22:48.720 --> 22:50.330
When we tried to restore Mount Qihuang's seal,

361
22:50.720 --> 22:51.370
Madam Su...

362
22:51.630 --> 22:52.700
Why did you suddenly withdraw your array?

363
22:53.240 --> 22:54.610
I... I didn't...

364
22:56.310 --> 22:56.770
I was...

365
23:03.210 --> 23:03.770
Wait here.

366
23:14.150 --> 23:15.260
To everyone else,

367
23:15.550 --> 23:16.400
I now look

368
23:16.400 --> 23:17.220
exactly like Su Hexiang.

369
23:17.370 --> 23:18.370
Why did you do this?

370
23:18.630 --> 23:20.130
And why did you cast a silencing spell on me?

371
23:20.550 --> 23:21.330
You said

372
23:21.720 --> 23:22.900
not to cause unnecessary trouble.

373
23:24.760 --> 23:26.420
You really know how to apply what you learn!

374
23:29.000 --> 23:30.130
I need to keep Hao here

375
23:30.480 --> 23:31.740
until I can tell him the truth.

376
23:39.440 --> 23:40.660
Master Du was concerned about me.

377
23:43.630 --> 23:44.740
About me, that is.

378
23:45.120 --> 23:46.560
He even sent his personal disciple

379
23:46.560 --> 23:47.460
to check on me.

380
23:48.000 --> 23:48.980
I appreciate his concern.

381
23:49.960 --> 23:51.020
We at Mount Leiguan

382
23:51.480 --> 23:52.850
know how to treat our guests.

383
23:53.440 --> 23:54.020
Prepare a feast.

384
23:54.550 --> 23:55.900
Let's give our young guests from Mount Zhaowu

385
23:55.960 --> 23:56.660
a proper welcome.

386
23:58.310 --> 23:58.940
Madam Su,

387
23:59.310 --> 23:59.770
there's no need.

388
24:01.790 --> 24:02.220
You there.

389
24:05.070 --> 24:06.530
Get him cleaned up and dressed properly.

390
24:07.280 --> 24:08.050
He's

391
24:08.110 --> 24:09.530
my newest inner disciple.

392
24:10.310 --> 24:11.420
Take good care of him.

393
24:11.920 --> 24:13.220
Make sure he looks his very best.

394
24:14.390 --> 24:15.610
Didn't you tell me

395
24:16.280 --> 24:17.420
you wanted to stay on Mount Leiguan?

396
24:18.630 --> 24:19.420
In that case,

397
24:19.590 --> 24:20.850
you'll have to fit in

398
24:21.520 --> 24:22.740
and follow our rules.

399
24:25.500 --> 24:27.740
[Zixiao Retreat]

400
24:34.680 --> 24:36.500
What kind of outfit is this?

401
24:36.660 --> 24:37.800
I'm

402
24:37.800 --> 24:39.370
a mighty ancient demon, after all.

403
24:43.070 --> 24:44.500
Why do you get to look so beautiful

404
24:44.590 --> 24:45.570
while I'm dressed so plainly?

405
24:45.790 --> 24:46.910
You think I'm happy about this?

406
24:47.060 --> 24:48.600
If your lord hadn't cast an illusion

407
24:48.720 --> 24:49.700
and put a silencing spell on me,

408
24:50.070 --> 24:50.930
we wouldn't have to

409
24:50.930 --> 24:51.900
keep up this whole act.

410
24:57.620 --> 24:58.220
Someone's coming.

411
25:04.530 --> 25:05.350
Madam.

412
25:05.390 --> 25:07.290
We've brought you some new hairpins.

413
25:24.790 --> 25:26.570
You're outer disciples, aren't you?

414
25:27.520 --> 25:28.610
Do you usually

415
25:29.680 --> 25:32.220
attend to me personally?

416
25:33.830 --> 25:35.500
Everyone else went to watch the show.

417
25:35.870 --> 25:37.130
Aren't you going to praise us, Madam?

418
25:37.480 --> 25:38.180
These hairpins

419
25:38.200 --> 25:39.530
were all made with our immortal powers.

420
25:41.870 --> 25:42.740
That's amazing!

421
25:45.720 --> 25:46.440
Lately...

422
25:46.440 --> 25:47.370
Things have been unsettled in the sect.

423
25:47.790 --> 25:48.700
You two, go back inside.

424
25:49.040 --> 25:50.090
Stay in your own courtyard.

425
25:50.960 --> 25:51.530
Don't come out.

426
25:51.720 --> 25:52.220
Do you hear me?

427
25:54.310 --> 25:55.500
Naughty little disciples

428
25:55.720 --> 25:56.980
will get a spanking from this senior.

429
25:59.440 --> 26:00.700
We've learned our lesson.

430
26:05.390 --> 26:05.850
Well?

431
26:06.350 --> 26:07.260
Those people from Mount Zhaowu...

432
26:07.280 --> 26:08.460
Want me to throw them out, too?

433
26:08.590 --> 26:09.610
Go ahead. Just try it.

434
26:10.200 --> 26:10.610
Wait.

435
26:11.830 --> 26:13.130
You're not

436
26:13.240 --> 26:14.660
planning to stir up trouble at the feast

437
26:14.790 --> 26:15.740
so His Lordship's identity

438
26:15.790 --> 26:16.610
gets exposed, are you?

439
26:16.720 --> 26:18.500
Qi Fengyin may be out of touch,

440
26:19.150 --> 26:20.130
but he's not stupid.

441
26:20.920 --> 26:21.810
If I did that,

442
26:22.080 --> 26:22.980
have you thought about what would happen?

443
26:23.310 --> 26:24.900
If they found out right there,

444
26:25.040 --> 26:26.330
a fight would break out.

445
26:27.240 --> 26:28.460
Those worthless fools

446
26:28.550 --> 26:29.740
are no match for His Lordship anyway.

447
26:31.490 --> 26:33.090
It's been ages since I've seen

448
26:33.090 --> 26:34.770
the immortal sects drenched in blood.

449
26:36.730 --> 26:37.570
What?

450
26:38.240 --> 26:38.970
Listen to me.

451
26:39.590 --> 26:40.610
Qi Fengyin may have

452
26:40.610 --> 26:41.570
given you a human body,

453
26:41.680 --> 26:43.260
but I'm the one who gathered your spirit

454
26:43.550 --> 26:44.700
using the doll

455
26:45.000 --> 26:46.460
I sewed with my own hands.

456
26:48.260 --> 26:49.330
And inside your belly,

457
26:49.630 --> 26:51.050
there's still my thread of fate.

458
26:51.460 --> 26:52.580
I'm the only one

459
26:52.870 --> 26:53.900
who actually wants to protect you.

460
26:55.590 --> 26:56.180
Anyway,

461
26:56.550 --> 26:57.290
if anything happens to me,

462
26:57.550 --> 26:58.700
let's see how well

463
26:58.760 --> 26:59.610
a doll stuffed with cotton fares.

464
27:02.720 --> 27:04.370
Well, of course I'm on your side.

465
27:04.680 --> 27:05.610
So what's your plan?

466
27:07.520 --> 27:08.370
The people from Mount Zhaowu

467
27:08.480 --> 27:10.130
have already noticed something's wrong with me.

468
27:10.480 --> 27:11.740
They'll definitely stay to investigate.

469
27:12.200 --> 27:13.330
Unlike Mount Qihuang,

470
27:13.330 --> 27:13.980
where day and night are indistinguishable,

471
27:14.350 --> 27:15.460
once the moon comes out tonight,

472
27:15.760 --> 27:16.530
my powers will return.

473
27:16.790 --> 27:18.330
Then I can break that devil's spell.

474
27:18.960 --> 27:19.370
After that,

475
27:19.550 --> 27:20.700
I'll reveal myself to Hao

476
27:20.920 --> 27:21.770
and figure out our next move with him.

477
27:22.390 --> 27:22.940
Madam.

478
27:23.520 --> 27:23.980
Madam.

479
27:25.920 --> 27:26.980
- Madam! - Madam!

480
27:28.310 --> 27:29.570
When did Madam

481
27:29.630 --> 27:30.570
slip into the hall without anyone noticing?

482
27:30.800 --> 27:31.750
I waited outside

483
27:31.750 --> 27:32.460
for quite a while,

484
27:32.590 --> 27:33.330
but I couldn't see you.

485
27:37.520 --> 27:39.290
Who's that ugly woman?

486
27:42.150 --> 27:44.220
She's my newest female disciple.

487
27:44.310 --> 27:45.260
A beautiful new disciple.

488
27:47.880 --> 27:48.420
Come.

489
27:48.720 --> 27:49.090
Sit.

490
27:57.390 --> 27:58.790
Now that all our young guests

491
27:58.790 --> 27:59.510
from Mount Zhaowu

492
27:59.510 --> 28:00.570
are here,

493
28:01.680 --> 28:02.660
let the feast begin.

494
28:23.960 --> 28:25.370
Mount Qihuang's seal has been broken.

495
28:25.570 --> 28:26.980
Qi Fengyin is on the loose.

496
28:27.390 --> 28:28.740
The world's in chaos,

497
28:29.390 --> 28:31.130
yet Madam Su is still busy having fun.

498
28:32.000 --> 28:32.900
Master was worried

499
28:32.920 --> 28:33.770
something had happened to her.

500
28:33.870 --> 28:34.700
He sent us here specifically

501
28:34.720 --> 28:35.460
to find out why she withdrew her array.

502
28:36.350 --> 28:37.330
He clearly misjudged her.

503
28:37.680 --> 28:38.090
Quiet.

504
28:39.240 --> 28:39.900
Yuwen,

505
28:40.440 --> 28:41.500
Yinhua may be a little harsh,

506
28:41.720 --> 28:42.980
but she has a point.

507
28:43.920 --> 28:44.900
We shouldn't judge others so quickly.

508
28:45.550 --> 28:46.180
Once we've

509
28:46.590 --> 28:48.130
found out why Mount Leiguan withdrew its array,

510
28:48.240 --> 28:49.420
we'll return and report to Master.

511
28:50.310 --> 28:50.850
Yes.

512
28:55.120 --> 28:57.420
How can I get Hao to recognize me?

513
28:58.000 --> 28:58.700
Madam, look.

514
29:00.790 --> 29:01.940
Those pills you gave me...

515
29:02.070 --> 29:03.130
I've only taken them for a few days,

516
29:03.210 --> 29:04.240
and my hair is already

517
29:04.240 --> 29:05.390
jet-black and shiny.

518
29:06.520 --> 29:07.420
What do you think, Madam?

519
29:07.480 --> 29:08.320
Isn't it

520
29:08.320 --> 29:09.220
much silkier than before?

521
29:09.680 --> 29:10.530
Madam, look at mine.

522
29:10.880 --> 29:12.570
It smells better than anyone else's hair.

523
29:12.960 --> 29:14.290
So this is what Su Hexiang likes?

524
29:15.550 --> 29:16.090
Madam.

525
29:16.840 --> 29:18.700
Is that a new hair ornament?

526
29:19.070 --> 29:20.260
How exquisite.

527
29:20.720 --> 29:21.370
Let me have a look.

528
29:21.830 --> 29:22.260
Don't touch me!

529
29:22.390 --> 29:23.020
Get away.

530
29:40.310 --> 29:41.180
What's he doing here?

531
29:44.390 --> 29:45.420
His cultivation

532
29:45.790 --> 29:46.530
is far beyond the ordinary.

533
29:55.790 --> 29:56.530
Fengxian.

534
29:57.550 --> 29:58.660
Mind your manners.

535
30:04.240 --> 30:04.980
He's

536
30:05.000 --> 30:06.530
my newest inner disciple.

537
30:07.200 --> 30:07.850
Fengxian.

538
30:08.110 --> 30:09.180
He may have a nasty temper,

539
30:09.440 --> 30:10.660
but he has a good heart.

540
30:15.410 --> 30:16.370
That'll be all.

541
30:16.530 --> 30:17.180
You may leave.

542
30:18.240 --> 30:19.450
- Madam! - Madam!

543
30:19.480 --> 30:20.740
None of you have any sense at all!

544
30:21.010 --> 30:22.500
Can't you see I'm entertaining guests?

545
30:22.720 --> 30:23.410
Look at the state of you!

546
30:23.410 --> 30:24.180
Have you no shame?

547
30:24.350 --> 30:24.740
Get out!

548
30:32.000 --> 30:32.570
You too.

549
30:41.440 --> 30:42.020
Didn't we agree

550
30:42.070 --> 30:43.020
not to cause unnecessary trouble?

551
30:55.310 --> 30:57.530
Fengxian must be hungry.

552
31:06.870 --> 31:07.260
My Lord.

553
31:28.150 --> 31:28.770
Yuwen Hao.

554
31:30.040 --> 31:31.740
You said your master sent you

555
31:31.760 --> 31:32.770
to check on me.

556
31:33.760 --> 31:34.570
Madam Su,

557
31:35.240 --> 31:36.130
the Five Great Sects

558
31:36.440 --> 31:37.420
had agreed to form an array

559
31:37.960 --> 31:39.220
to reinforce Mount Qihuang's seal.

560
31:39.720 --> 31:40.700
But just before the seal was restored,

561
31:40.870 --> 31:42.260
Mount Leiguan suddenly withdrew its array.

562
31:42.720 --> 31:43.570
This is a serious matter.

563
31:44.200 --> 31:45.420
My master knows you

564
31:45.960 --> 31:47.020
wouldn't withdraw without good reason.

565
31:47.630 --> 31:48.570
He was concerned

566
31:48.790 --> 31:49.610
something had happened at Mount Leiguan.

567
31:50.520 --> 31:50.980
That's right.

568
31:51.960 --> 31:53.570
I withdrew the array on purpose.

569
31:55.440 --> 31:56.420
Don't you think

570
31:56.720 --> 31:57.500
Qi Fengyin

571
31:57.550 --> 31:58.660
has been locked up on Mount Qihuang for so long

572
31:59.790 --> 32:01.020
that perhaps he's already

573
32:01.040 --> 32:01.810
seen the error of his ways?

574
32:02.350 --> 32:03.740
I actually feel sorry for him.

575
32:05.480 --> 32:06.420
Hao,

576
32:06.960 --> 32:08.660
please tell me you can read between the lines.

577
32:09.350 --> 32:10.850
How can you say that, Madam Su?

578
32:10.930 --> 32:11.860
Qi Fengyin is

579
32:11.860 --> 32:13.330
a bloodthirsty, ruthless devil!

580
32:13.520 --> 32:14.660
If we spare his life,

581
32:14.760 --> 32:16.370
do you really think he'd spare

582
32:16.390 --> 32:17.130
the lives of innocent people?

583
32:25.440 --> 32:26.050
Madam Su,

584
32:27.110 --> 32:28.530
Qi Fengyin was born

585
32:28.530 --> 32:29.260
from the world's malice.

586
32:30.040 --> 32:31.020
He is evil itself.

587
32:31.300 --> 32:32.420
He can never turn to good.

588
32:32.880 --> 32:33.460
Yes.

589
32:34.680 --> 32:36.050
What I said earlier

590
32:36.380 --> 32:37.570
was indeed inappropriate.

591
32:39.950 --> 32:41.850
This is Mount Leiguan's finest wine.

592
32:42.590 --> 32:43.260
Consider it

593
32:43.870 --> 32:44.810
my apology.

594
32:54.830 --> 32:55.900
There's no need for that, Madam Su.

595
32:58.720 --> 32:59.220
Yuwen!

596
33:01.440 --> 33:02.290
How unfortunate.

597
33:02.720 --> 33:04.740
Even magic can't get rid of that wine smell.

598
33:04.960 --> 33:06.090
You'd better go change your clothes.

599
33:06.630 --> 33:07.090
Someone.

600
33:08.720 --> 33:10.500
Take Yuwen Hao to bathe and change.

601
33:10.720 --> 33:11.180
Yes, Madam.

602
33:11.960 --> 33:12.330
This way, please.

603
33:23.960 --> 33:24.940
My Lord...

604
33:32.110 --> 33:32.980
- It's not my fault. - You...

605
33:33.040 --> 33:34.380
He wanted to try it himself.

606
33:34.520 --> 33:35.960
How was I supposed to know one drop

607
33:36.040 --> 33:37.440
would knock him out like a little kid?

608
33:37.630 --> 33:38.330
Youyou.

609
33:39.240 --> 33:40.330
You've done me a huge favor.

610
33:44.010 --> 33:45.500
My young friends from Mount Zhaowu,

611
33:45.500 --> 33:46.090
help yourselves.

612
33:46.440 --> 33:47.130
Make yourselves at home.

613
33:47.520 --> 33:48.770
I'll be back shortly.

614
33:54.720 --> 33:55.700
Don't you think

615
33:56.350 --> 33:57.220
Madam Su

616
33:57.870 --> 33:58.770
is acting a little strange?

617
34:00.390 --> 34:01.370
She seems

618
34:01.790 --> 34:03.290
to keep staring at Yuwen.

619
34:03.960 --> 34:05.220
Maybe she's

620
34:05.220 --> 34:06.180
fallen for him.

621
34:10.110 --> 34:11.300
Can't you carry him yourself?

622
34:11.300 --> 34:12.820
Do I look strong enough to lift him?

623
34:20.670 --> 34:21.650
He's so heavy.

624
34:24.270 --> 34:24.650
You...

625
34:26.920 --> 34:27.300
Let go.

626
34:27.400 --> 34:28.340
Don't touch it.

627
34:31.320 --> 34:31.940
Touch what?

628
34:34.590 --> 34:35.460
Your mystical flower?

629
34:37.320 --> 34:38.500
What exactly is it?

630
34:39.150 --> 34:40.300
Why do you treasure it so much?

631
34:41.520 --> 34:42.610
A thousand years of cultivation,

632
34:43.000 --> 34:44.460
all to make this mystical flower bloom.

633
34:45.190 --> 34:46.730
And now you're even willing

634
34:47.230 --> 34:48.500
to disguise yourself as an immortal disciple for it.

635
34:49.840 --> 34:51.940
Does it produce

636
34:52.320 --> 34:53.780
some legendary elixir when it blooms

637
34:54.270 --> 34:55.610
that makes you invincible?

638
34:55.960 --> 34:57.410
His Lordship became the Devil Incarnate

639
34:57.410 --> 34:58.860
just by absorbing malice.

640
34:58.920 --> 35:00.210
Why would he need an elixir?

641
35:02.670 --> 35:03.940
Then what's so special about this flower?

642
35:07.750 --> 35:08.420
The flower...

643
35:10.150 --> 35:11.420
holds her spirit.

644
35:15.590 --> 35:16.570
When it blooms,

645
35:17.960 --> 35:19.530
she can come back.

646
35:22.550 --> 35:23.170
She?

647
35:23.590 --> 35:24.340
Who's that?

648
35:25.800 --> 35:26.460
Who?

649
35:29.420 --> 35:31.780
[Zixiao Retreat]

650
35:40.710 --> 35:42.660
Do you think His Lordship

651
35:43.000 --> 35:44.730
was talking about a woman?

652
35:45.270 --> 35:45.820
Impossible.

653
35:46.110 --> 35:46.980
How could that devil

654
35:47.040 --> 35:48.020
ever have a love life?

655
35:49.190 --> 35:49.940
You never know.

656
36:07.600 --> 36:08.610
Oh, my!

657
36:08.740 --> 36:09.730
What on earth

658
36:09.750 --> 36:10.860
does Su Hexiang practice in here?

659
36:22.710 --> 36:23.610
This'll do.

660
36:29.360 --> 36:29.690
You.

661
36:30.150 --> 36:30.860
Stay here and watch him.

662
36:31.550 --> 36:32.460
Don't let him wander off.

663
36:33.040 --> 36:34.130
And don't let anyone else in.

664
36:34.590 --> 36:35.090
Got it?

665
36:38.000 --> 36:38.690
Or I'll burn

666
36:38.710 --> 36:39.650
your true form to ashes.

667
36:40.630 --> 36:41.090
Got it!

668
36:47.020 --> 36:54.220
[Zixiao Retreat]

669
37:02.360 --> 37:03.300
No moonlight.

670
37:03.360 --> 37:04.210
Just as I thought. No powers.

671
37:11.040 --> 37:11.420
You.

672
37:23.440 --> 37:23.900
Madam.

673
37:24.040 --> 37:25.380
Do you know where Yuwen Hao...

674
37:27.880 --> 37:29.380
The chief disciple

675
37:29.710 --> 37:30.650
of Mount Zhaowu is right now?

676
37:31.110 --> 37:31.730
Have you

677
37:33.110 --> 37:34.730
started going after disciples from other sects too?

678
37:35.110 --> 37:35.530
What?

679
37:39.840 --> 37:41.250
No, you've got it all wrong.

680
37:41.590 --> 37:42.420
I'm not trying to

681
37:42.480 --> 37:43.460
do anything inappropriate to him.

682
37:50.590 --> 37:51.050
Madam.

683
37:52.360 --> 37:52.900
This way, please.

684
38:20.400 --> 38:21.610
What a strange man.

685
38:21.960 --> 38:23.090
He doesn't seem like a Mount Leiguan disciple.

686
38:23.750 --> 38:25.610
He doesn't fawn over people

687
38:25.670 --> 38:27.460
like Su Hexiang's inner disciples do.

688
38:33.110 --> 38:34.050
What am I thinking?

689
38:34.840 --> 38:35.940
To Hao,

690
38:36.230 --> 38:37.210
I look exactly

691
38:37.230 --> 38:38.050
like Su Hexiang right now.

692
38:38.590 --> 38:39.250
Why would he ever

693
38:39.270 --> 38:40.210
open the door for her?

694
38:46.070 --> 38:46.780
Please forgive me.

695
38:47.040 --> 38:48.130
You're the only one

696
38:48.520 --> 38:49.300
who can save my master now.

697
39:03.000 --> 39:04.170
Hao, it's me.

698
39:05.670 --> 39:06.250
Hao.

699
39:06.710 --> 39:07.210
It's me!

700
39:11.920 --> 39:12.500
Madam Su.

701
39:13.000 --> 39:13.820
You're the leader of an immortal sect.

702
39:14.040 --> 39:14.650
Please show some restraint

703
39:15.190 --> 39:16.170
and don't cross the line.

704
39:16.270 --> 39:17.170
No, Hao!

705
39:17.220 --> 39:18.080
I have something important to tell you!

706
39:18.080 --> 39:19.280
I'm not here to watch you bathe!

707
39:19.280 --> 39:20.120
I can only tell you in private.

708
39:20.120 --> 39:20.940
- If it's a private matter... - I...

709
39:21.270 --> 39:22.460
At least let me get dressed first.

710
39:22.630 --> 39:23.610
Please leave, Madam Su.

711
39:23.670 --> 39:24.750
Wait? I've waited so long

712
39:24.750 --> 39:25.530
for this chance!

713
39:25.630 --> 39:26.660
If I wait any longer, I'll lose it!

714
39:26.660 --> 39:27.360
In that case,

715
39:27.670 --> 39:28.730
I'll have to summon someone.

716
39:28.960 --> 39:29.380
Someone...

717
39:44.320 --> 39:44.860
I'm sorry.

718
39:56.440 --> 39:57.500
The man I brought back...

719
39:57.670 --> 39:58.380
He's actually...

720
40:01.000 --> 40:01.730
He and Mount Qihuang...

721
40:06.270 --> 40:07.020
I really have no

722
40:07.040 --> 40:07.860
improper intentions toward you.

723
40:08.040 --> 40:09.090
I just want you to take me away!

724
40:09.360 --> 40:09.940
Take you away?

725
40:16.800 --> 40:18.170
I can't tell you the truth right now.

726
40:18.440 --> 40:18.980
Madam Su.

727
40:19.750 --> 40:20.650
What exactly are you trying to say?

728
40:21.320 --> 40:22.420
You don't have to believe me.

729
40:22.920 --> 40:23.820
Just take this with you.

730
40:41.630 --> 40:42.500
What are you doing here?

731
40:43.320 --> 40:43.780
I...

732
40:47.840 --> 40:48.170
I...

733
40:51.270 --> 40:52.130
Nothing happened

734
40:53.230 --> 40:54.380
between Madam Su and me.

735
41:32.110 --> 41:32.460
Let's go.

736
41:46.400 --> 41:47.340
The spiritual mark is still intact.

737
41:48.230 --> 41:49.460
Looks like nothing happened.

738
41:50.270 --> 41:50.860
Yuwen.

739
41:51.320 --> 41:52.980
I was worried Madam Su spilled that wine

740
41:53.040 --> 41:54.090
because she had something improper in mind.

741
41:54.400 --> 41:55.250
That's why I rushed over.

742
41:55.840 --> 41:56.690
Thank goodness you're all right.

743
42:00.360 --> 42:00.860
Looks like

744
42:02.400 --> 42:03.530
we'll have to stay here tonight.

745
42:11.320 --> 42:12.690
Why are you looking at me?

746
42:13.000 --> 42:13.940
Look how small I am.

747
42:14.320 --> 42:15.570
You think I could take him on?

748
42:15.750 --> 42:16.760
You could've at least kept him busy

749
42:16.760 --> 42:17.860
for a little longer.

750
42:18.230 --> 42:18.690
I...

751
42:30.710 --> 42:31.820
If you're so afraid of dying,

752
42:32.960 --> 42:34.170
why do you keep doing such foolish things?

753
42:39.000 --> 42:40.570
Haven't I done enough to help you?

754
42:40.980 --> 42:42.490
You turned me into Su Hexiang,

755
42:43.000 --> 42:44.300
and I did my best to play the part.

756
42:44.340 --> 42:45.500
I didn't want anyone suspecting you,

757
42:45.800 --> 42:47.380
so I even gave you a new identity.

758
42:48.000 --> 42:49.050
I've gone out of my way to cover for you

759
42:49.110 --> 42:50.500
so Mount Zhaowu wouldn't find out.

760
42:50.960 --> 42:52.380
You know nothing about the outside world,

761
42:52.550 --> 42:53.730
and I've been teaching you everything.

762
42:54.800 --> 42:56.170
How much more considerate can I be?

763
43:16.590 --> 43:17.420
Then

764
43:18.920 --> 43:20.570
why did you sneak off to see that man?

765
43:22.590 --> 43:23.250
Because...

766
43:25.480 --> 43:26.380
Because I like him.

767
43:44.440 --> 43:45.250
The disciple named Fengxian,

768
43:45.440 --> 43:46.460
who's always with Madam Su,

769
43:46.710 --> 43:47.420
has a mysterious past.

770
43:47.710 --> 43:48.460
He's not to be trusted.

771
43:48.630 --> 43:50.530
This man is nothing but trouble!

772
43:50.710 --> 43:51.860
Last night, I saw it all!

773
43:52.110 --> 43:53.020
He was using both hands

774
43:53.320 --> 43:54.300
to absorb black mist from the sky!

775
43:54.320 --> 43:54.690
Silence!

776
43:55.110 --> 43:56.210
Yuwen Hao's here.

777
43:59.040 --> 43:59.940
You've been kissed by a woman.

778
44:00.190 --> 44:00.820
You're not pure anymore.

779
44:23.100 --> 44:27.140
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

780
44:27.380 --> 44:30.820
♪So many longings♪

781
44:31.500 --> 44:33.580
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

782
44:33.780 --> 44:38.780
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

783
44:39.700 --> 44:43.740
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

784
44:43.980 --> 44:47.420
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

785
44:48.100 --> 44:50.180
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

786
44:50.380 --> 44:57.780
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

787
44:59.180 --> 45:02.860
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

788
45:03.100 --> 45:06.780
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

789
45:07.420 --> 45:10.980
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

790
45:11.300 --> 45:15.460
♪Still waits to come true♪

791
45:15.700 --> 45:19.380
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

792
45:19.940 --> 45:23.580
♪I'll stay by your side♪

793
45:24.060 --> 45:27.660
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

794
45:27.900 --> 45:35.220
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

795
45:48.700 --> 45:52.740
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

796
45:52.980 --> 45:56.420
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

797
45:57.100 --> 45:59.180
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

798
